sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant LK as LiveKit AvatarRunner
    participant Gen as AlwaysBusyGenerator
    participant TP as TalkingProducer
    participant Drv as Driver
    participant Sess as InferenceSession
    participant W as Triton worker

    alt natural end
        LK->>Gen: push_audio(AudioEnd)
        Gen->>TP: forward AudioEnd (input closes)
        TP->>TP: preprocessor.flush() → tail chunks<br/>last tail chunk carries morph_config (talking→idle)<br/>empty flush — no tail chunk, no morph
        TP->>Drv: stream.put(tail...) · put(None) = in-band COMPLETED
        Drv->>Drv: dispatcher sees StreamEnd → graceful buffer shutdown
        Drv->>Drv: pacer drains all remaining frames → stream.complete()
        Drv-->>Gen: StreamEnd(COMPLETED) after last frame
        Gen->>Gen: observer.on_end → end_sequence(COMPLETED)
        Gen-->>LK: yield SequenceEnd(COMPLETED) → AudioSegmentEnd
    else interrupt (user barge-in)
        LK->>Gen: clear_buffer → interrupt()
        Gen->>Gen: stream.cancel() + producer_task.cancel()
        Note over Drv: ended future resolves CANCELLED immediately.<br/>Frames still in inference_buffer are dropped
        Drv->>Drv: pacer keeps relaying until broadcast_queue<br/>reaches its 0.2s target (queue full)
        Drv-->>Gen: StreamEnd(CANCELLED)
        Drv->>Drv: cancel dispatcher — in-flight Triton request abandoned
        Gen->>Gen: observer.on_end → end_sequence(CANCELLED)
        Gen-->>LK: yield SequenceEnd(CANCELLED) → AudioSegmentEnd
    end

    Drv->>Drv: _spawn_idle — fresh idle stream + producer
    Drv->>Sess: idle chunk 0: cancel_previous=True,<br/>pass_prev_context=True (context ring)
    Sess->>W: request_id_to_cancel = abandoned talking request<br/>prev_motion/audio_feat = last ~10 paced frames
    W->>W: cancel stale work · generate idle<br/>continuing from the pose the user last saw
    W-->>LK: idle frames flow (via Sess → Drv → Gen)
